WEBVTT

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:06.610
Your greetings are always so rough, Gina.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.410
Makai Alchemists are busy people.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.950
Dammit.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.880
This always happens to me
when I get involved with her.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:21.120
If my brother's disappearance
has to do with Horrors and El Dorado,

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.090
I need your help!

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.540
Please help me find my brother!

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.750
Welcome!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:36.720
Unfortunately, we must turn away
anyone who has no method to--

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.510
One orange juice.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.260
Managed to get some pocket money.

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:45.410
Would you like a cheese dog
and avocado salad with that?

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:47.680
Just an orange juice!

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.320
Here you go!

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:11.990
Today will be the day I make him say yes.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.050
We'll solve the mystery
of El Dorado together.

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:18.260
I'm sure that it's an important
clue for my brother's whereabouts.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.070
Welcome!

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:24.280
My respects.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.640
And I'd like my usual, please.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:28.190
--Swo--
--Good morning, Sword.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.220
Ugh!

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:33.690
Sorry it's so sudden, but I need your help.

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:38.010
Will you marry me?

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:05.930
<i>The monochromatic empty eyes</i>
<i>of</i> <i>sapiens</i> <i>floating</i> <i>within the unreality</i>

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:11.310
<i>Completely peerless flowing</i> <i>blood,</i>
<i>controlled</i> <i>and digitized</i>

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:12.980
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.400
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.570
<i>Can you see?</i>

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:17.740
<i>(BOOING BOOING) Hellacious</i>

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.110
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:20.780
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:21.820
<i>I can see!</i>

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.830
<i>The timing of the programming</i>

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:24.700
<i>Yea, gotcha!</i>

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.410
<i>I want to be eroded away (brain wash)</i>

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.580
<i>Up the blast! </i>

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:34.630
<i>Ah, this dying world </i>

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:41.140
<i>Run like you're piercing through it</i>

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:47.470
<i>The rising flames burn everything away </i>

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:52.150
<i>Your resolve and your love</i>

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:55.730
<i>From darkness to the light</i>

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:46.280
Darling, will you please
escort our sweet little daughter?

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.170
Y-Yeah.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:51.470
Come on.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.250
Huh?

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.040
Yeah...

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.240
Oh, goodness. My apologies!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:31.630
Welcome to my home.
I am the master of this house, Viola.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:35.550
I contacted you a few days ago,
we are the Brown family.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.540
This is my husband
and our daughter, Emily.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.380
Hello.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.010
Nice to meet you, Mr. Brown.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.590
Emily.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:48.600
So, this is Lady Viola.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.400
A ring that controls Horrors?

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.560
It's still just a rumor, though.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:02.150
Lady Viola. She was an
actress when she was young...

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.490
...but she never really stood out.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:13.870
Then, suddenly, her rivals dropped
out due to injuries and scandals.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.250
She rose to the top weaving
her way through those events

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.170
and married a businessman.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.760
After her husband died a few years later,

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:26.050
she began to work as
an educational consultant.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:30.260
She listens to the child raising
woes of rich parents

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.320
while gaining fame and wealth.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.730
A true success story.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.070
You're saying that success
was due to a Horror?

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:47.320
They say she has a "ring that
controls demons" in her possession.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:51.910
The demon whispers words
into her ears, bringing her fortune.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.120
Is there really a ring like that?!

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.370
How long have you been here?

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.120
Kids should just drink up
their juice and go home.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.170
No!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:05.550
Until I find out what El Dorado is,
I'll never let you escape!

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:09.710
That's what we're going to find out.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:16.430
Please tell me all about it, later.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:20.690
I hope I can be of
some help to your family.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.940
Thank you very much.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:25.820
My husband always leaves
all the matters of the house to me...

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.490
I-It can't be helped.
I'm busy with work, myself.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.410
It's always like this!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.740
And my daughter
doesn't listen to me at all.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:38.160
Well, I don't really
need any advice from you.

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.870
I can do things on my own!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:41.960
Emily!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:43.850
Emily.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.970
I just want to become friends with you.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.680
Why not grab a bite to eat first?

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:54.350
There are other girls your age here as well.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.820
What about Indonesia?

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.770
I heard M & A was a success.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.770
Things are pretty difficult.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:07.070
We were able to prevent
the sale of Crown Jewel,

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:10.030
but now they're attacking
with image branding.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.500
To begin with, the government's
foreign policies are too weak.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.280
So true.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.040
What are your thoughts?

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.150
W-Well,

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.500
things aren't
too bad for us right now.

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:33.470
I wonder if my stupid child will
gain something through her care?

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:38.390
They must. The consulting
fee here isn't cheap.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:43.520
I hear the daughter of the Spencer
family is as quiet as a kitten now.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:46.980
I wonder what kind
of magic Lady Viola used.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:51.360
I don't care. As long as
money can solve the problem!

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.490
This shitty cat! It scratched me!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:08:00.250
Hi, Emily. Are you enjoying yourself?

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.740
N-Not really?!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.300
This house is full of cats.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.590
I have no children of my own.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:18.960
That's why I love it when
children like you come over to play.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:28.190
I'm so tired.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.440
Good job.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.950
What are you thinking?

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:39.830
You involved a kid who
has nothing to do with us.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:44.310
It's fine. It's adorable that
she asked you to look for her brother.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.820
I know you could have pushed
her away if you really wanted to.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:54.510
If she's serious about getting involved,

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:56.720
she should see how things are for herself.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:00.680
She needs to know
exactly what it is that we do.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.180
It stinks.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.020
There's one here.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.820
Is it Lady Viola?

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.120
The stink is everywhere.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.200
I'm not really sure.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:20.030
Looks like we'll have to confirm directly.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.820
You brought her here,
so take responsibility.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:26.460
Yes. Yes.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.380
It seems like you are the shy type, Emily.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.840
Uh. Emily,

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.420
Mama is calling for you.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:36.400
Huh?

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.280
Okay!

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.250
Mr. Brown.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:48.850
Mr. Brown?

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.440
Huh? Oh, she's talking to me.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.980
Oh, excuse me.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:57.320
Your daughter Emily is
quite a sweet young lady.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:02.280
No, no. She doesn't listen
to me at all, she skips school,

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.500
and she steals money from the house.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.660
I really don't know what to do about her.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.380
I've lost my confidence as a parent.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.840
Do not worry, Mr. Brown.

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.480
I am your ally.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.840
Oh, Lady Viola!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:24.520
If you can use magic, as the
rumors say, please use it on us!

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:29.810
Magic. Such an exaggeration.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:35.990
I merely think of the best
method for her, together with you.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.530
The best method?

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.670
Yes. Together.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:47.660
Why not tell me more
about yourself, first?

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:53.290
A relationship of trust between
us is important for her future.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.750
T-Trust?

00:10:54.750 --> 00:11:00.510
Yes. You have quite a nice body.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:02.860
P-Putting that aside, Lady Viola.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:07.020
What kind of lessons do
you teach the children here?

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.660
Let us talk about such drab things later.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:16.040
Hey, it's started again!
Lady Viola's bad habit.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:20.860
She doesn't just turn children
into kittens, but parents, too.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.300
As expected of her!

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.490
Really. What kind of
method does she use?

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:35.860
Let's get along, Mr. Brown.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:43.340
These breasts. I can't admire them at all.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.160
I'm so tired.

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.040
This is where things
get serious, you know?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.290
I know, but...

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:15.540
I didn't know people
from upper town were like that.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:19.670
They care more about money
and appearances, than their kid.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:23.350
Not everyone is like that,

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:28.350
but everyone gathered here try to
solve all their problems with money.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.290
Even though they're family.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.600
There are people who don't
understand things like that.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:36.910
It's a pity.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.980
Why do you do work like this, Gina?

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:56.790
It's dangerous finding
and destroying Horrors.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.220
Aren't you scared?

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.700
Yes. I am.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.050
Then, why?

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.050
Maybe because it makes a lot of money.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:25.900
It looks like these are the rooms
for the children she cares for.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.110
There's no one here.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:38.790
Gina.

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:41.100
Doesn't this spot look weird?

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.170
Good job noticing.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.050
I did something like this in the past.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:50.410
I hid a letter to Santa and
kept it a secret from my brother.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.870
This looks like the diary of
the child who stayed in this room.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:57.580
Huh?

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:07.280
"The rumors were true. Lady Viola
really does have a demon servant."

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:18.480
"Everyone caught by the demon
become empty, soulless dolls.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:23.800
No. I don't want to
become like that, too!"

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:28.130
"Something terrifying happened.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.660
Will tried to run and the demon...

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:35.320
No! The image is burned
into my mind!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.300
Someone save me!"

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.150
"At this rate, I'll be eaten, too!"

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:50.200
So all the kids here
were eaten by a Horror?!

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:54.250
But, wouldn't the parents raise a
fuss if the children didn't come back?!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.710
There are people who don't, Sophie.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:02.350
Sometimes it's hard to tell
which are the true demons.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:29.360
Some of the people who come
to get advice from Lady Viola

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.620
disappear from the public or go missing.

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:36.490
Since the world up the upper class
has many ups and downs,

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.950
that in itself isn't all that rare.

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:48.550
I'm sure some parents didn't
stay quiet when their child didn't return.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:52.930
But, in the end, they all...

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:57.440
What is this place?

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.790
A common altar for demon worship.

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:06.560
It seems Lady Viola tried to make
a contract with a demon, a Horror,

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.690
here in this place.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.910
Can you really do something like that?!

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:16.080
Nibelung. Solomon. Prometheus.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:20.730
Rings are commonly used as
a tool to imbue with magical power.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:25.750
The legend of a ring that can
control a powerful Horror has existed

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.140
since ancient times.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.130
If something like that really existed,

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:33.710
collectors would pay a pretty penny for it.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:35.270
Gina!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.230
I see. As I thought, that's how it is.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:00.900
Let's make this a wonderful night.

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:04.230
Save me, Gina!

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:24.070
Wait here. I'll be right back.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:33.530
Sophie. This is the kind of job that we do.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:37.990
If you involve yourself
with Makai Knights,

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:43.790
you'll have to see and overcome
a reality like this countless of times.

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.500
Have you prepared yourself for that?

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:07.060
Wandering into a place like this.
What troublesome guests.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:16.320
As we thought, you're controlling
a Horror with those rings.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:21.680
I see. It seems you are not normal guests.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:26.960
Yes. I am a Makai Alchemist
who has come to eliminate you.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.290
Foolish thing.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:32.170
I don't know how much
confidence you may have,

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:36.720
but can you beat someone
contracted with this many Horrors?

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:40.090
They are all hungry.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.720
Now, go on!

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.890
All fakes.

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:56.110
A ring powerful enough
to control a Horror...

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.860
...wouldn't break so easily.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.280
You don't have any
Horrors under your control.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.390
You are the Horror yourself!

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:11.290
You tried to control a
summoned Horror with a fake ring

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:15.620
and got eaten up yourself, instead.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.150
You're wrong!

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:44.070
You're wrong! You're wrong!
You're wrong! You're wrong!

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:48.260
You're wrong!

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:24.440
Is that the magic you used to
turn your sacrifices into "kittens"?

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.090
Sword!

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.050
You're late.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:43.480
It was really dangerous for me, too!
In various ways!

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:47.350
Well, looks like there was
no need for me, anyways.

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:50.290
Yeah, I was just about to finish up.

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:52.710
Got it. Got it.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:13.200
Looks like you couldn't get your hands
on any treasure this time, either.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:18.040
They're hard to get, which is
why they're worth chasing after.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:24.050
And once you do, you dangle it
in front of weirdos for a crazy price.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:28.430
Well, I'll dangle it in front of
them whether I find them or not.

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:30.430
Stop, Sword.

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:32.640
She's not someone you can beat.

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:38.020
Sophie.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.440
You've decided.

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.030
Yes.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:45.360
What's going on?

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:46.660
You better be prepared.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:50.200
When women band together,
no man can beat them.

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:53.660
Come on! I'm going to
have you say yes today!

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:54.180
Huh?

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:57.040
Let's look for information
on El Dorado, together!

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.380
H-Hey, Sophie.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:02.130
Tell me everything you know, first.

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:06.590
To begin with, why did you
start looking for El Dorado, Sword?

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:10.550
H-Hey, Gina! Don't leave me here!

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:13.180
Sword! Answer my questions!

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:15.430
--Huh? Just be quiet!
--Don't run from me! This time for sure!

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:17.600
--Hey, Gina! I said, don't leave me here!
--Don't run from me! This time for sure!

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.440
Sword!

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:19.520
Hold on!

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:41.000
<i>When I close my eyes I feel</i>
<i>gentle</i> <i>arms</i> <i>around</i> <i>me</i>

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:45.460
<i>Warmth and memory</i>

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:49.840
<i>SIGHT I can feel it now</i>

